53, a documentary spy thriller that unpicks the MI6 and CIA coup in Iran to expose the roots of todays tensions. Both film makers will then take part in a Q and A session about their individual films and what they tell us about the west and the middle east then and today.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Timings are:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>1- 2.45 pm We are Many<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>2.45-3.15 pm interval&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>3.15-5.15 pm Coup 53<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>5.15- 5.45 pm Q and A with Amir and Taghi Amirani<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/metrocinema.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1782237952unnamed.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/metrocinema.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1782237952unnamed-1.webp\",\"url_key\":\"coup53\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.metrocinema.co.uk\\/movies\\/coup53?location=metro-cinema&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-12\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=4Bf2CB45ndo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"4Bf2CB45ndo\",\"duration\":\"5h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2019\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ralph Fiennes\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[{\"id\":\"4\",\"name\":\"English Language\",\"short_name\":\"English\",\"description\":null}],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, online booking isn\\u2019t available at the moment. Please visit the theatre to purchase your tickets. The website will be fully operational in a few days.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"2002\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"eHcrS0g1Z1JncE9tV3M2MHU4VWtYUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.metrocinema.co.uk\\/movies\\/coup53\\/show